\pard{\pntext\f5\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf5\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\nowidctlpar\fi-360\li720\sl240\slmult0\tx720\cf0\b0\f2\fs24 Added support for CORXFER_PRM_BUFFER_TIMESTAMP_MODULE to be set to CORXFER_VAL_BUFFER_TIMESTAMP_MODULE_ACQ with following events available: CORACQ_VAL_EVENT_TYPE_START_OF_FRAME and CORACQ_VAL_EVENT_TYPE_EXTERNAL_TRIGGER\cf2\f0\par
